  id: Scene06_FAQ_1
  speaker: WATTSON
  text: 'It means we change only one thing, the potential difference, and keep the
    rest fixed: the same wire, the same material, the same length and thickness,
    and the same temperature. Then whatever happens to the current, we know what
    caused it.'
